# JSON globs with differently sampled files (no DS3005), mixed NDJSON + JSON-array `*.json` globs,
# and UTF-8 BOM-prefixed NDJSON and JSON-array files.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../data/json/glob_types/*.ndjson' | sort by id asc;
from '../../data/json/glob_layout/*.json' | sort by id asc;
from '../../data/json/bom_ndjson.json';
from '../../data/json/bom_array.json'
---- expected
id   | null_then_obj | str_or_obj | num_or_str | widen | always_null
long | dynamic       | dynamic    | dynamic    | real  | dynamic
-----+---------------+------------+------------+-------+------------
   1 | null          | "hello"    | 10         |   1.0 | null
   2 | {"k":1}       | {"k":2}    | "ten"      |   2.5 | null

